# Token-usage tracking — per-developer-per-machine local state
# (see docs/specs/2026-05-14-token-usage-tracking.md FR-10)
#
# Both files contain user_email values and per-developer turn-level data.
# They are derived from the global file at ~/.claude/forge-usage.jsonl
# (which lives outside any repo by location) — committing them would
# (a) leak email addresses, (b) cause merge conflicts across developers
# since each dev's machine produces a different filtered slice.
#
# For team-wide usage rollup, the spec's Phase 2 scheduler-to-DB story is
# the appropriate channel; the local files stay local.
.forge/usage.jsonl
.forge/dashboard/usage.js

# Delivery metrics v1 ledgers are committable role/project facts.
# Future token-joined variants remain local/private.
.forge/metrics/*.local.jsonl
